# IS2 over SCTP: a leaf server which uplinks to the IS2 full feed SCTP port
# of is2-sctp.

ServerId   TESTING-2
PassCode   31421
MyEmail    email@example.com
MyAdmin    "Admin, N0CALL"

### Directories #########
# Data directory (for database files)
RunDir data

### Intervals #########
UpstreamTimeout		90s
ClientTimeout		48h

### TCP listeners ##########
Listen "Full feed"       fullfeed    tcp ::0      55153    acl "cfg-aprsc/acl-all.acl"
Listen "Igate port"      igate       tcp 0.0.0.0  55583    acl "cfg-aprsc/acl-all.acl"

### IS2 uplink over SCTP
Uplink is2sctp full sctp 127.0.0.1 56152 is2

### HTTP server
HTTPStatus 127.0.0.1 55502
